      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "More homogeneous plastic flow distributes plastic strain uniformly and delays crack initiation.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At 1000–1500°C, pure tungsten deforms predominantly by localized dislocation glide with limited dynamic recovery.",
